### Correct Approach (Let's assume we're using a new connection):
```csharp
using (var context = new MyDbContext())
{
    var myEntity = new MyEntity { Name = "John" };
    context.MyEntities.Add(myEntity);
    context.SaveChanges(); // This will save the record

    // Use a new connection to insert the record
    using (var newContext = new MyDbContext())
    {
        newContext.MyEntities.Add(myEntity);
        newContext.SaveChanges();
    }
}
```

